<title>JAPAN: Japan Oct rapeseed imports up 10.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Oct rapeseed imports up 10.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's rapeseed imports in October totalled 189,120 tonnes, up 10.4 percent from the 171,335 tonnes recorded a year earlier, according to Finance Ministry statistics released on Thursday.</p>
<p>The breakdown was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>			Oct 96	 Sept 96	Oct 95</p>
<p> Total rapeseed   189,120	164,776	171,335</p>
<p>Major suppliers of rapeseed (in tonnes):</p>
<p> Canada	     144,042	157,379	171,330</p>
<p> France		38,544	  6,541	    nil</p>
<p>Imports in the first ten months of 1996 were 1,606,377 tonnes, versus 1,482,350 tonnes in the same period of 1995.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-7391</p>
